{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43178","headline":"登瓦官寺阁 · 李宾","name":"登瓦官寺阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨登瓦官阁，极眺金陵城。\n锺山对北户，淮水入南荣。\n漫漫雨花落，嘈嘈天乐鸣。\n两廊振法鼓，四角吹风筝。\n杳无霄汉上，仰攀日月行。\n山空霸气灭，地古寒阴生。\n寥廓云海晚，苍茫宫观平。\n门余阊阖字，楼识凤凰名。\n雷作百川动，神扶万栱倾。\n灵光一向贵，长此镇吴京。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李宾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43178.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43178","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}